  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37885760",
      "title": "Creating Icons",
      "sourceHash": "8959f13b1f11050f2e3e71769193997bf0322bbb4e80b81a1ba3d7f0759254ba",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 4.68,
          "en": "We now learned a lot about creating images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.68,
          "end": 7.65,
          "en": "and we also know how to use custom parameters",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.65,
          "end": 11.16,
          "en": "to reuse certain styles, certain attributes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.16,
          "end": 14.07,
          "en": "of the images that should be generated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.07,
          "end": 16.53,
          "en": "Now I wanna give you one idea at hand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.53,
          "end": 18.39,
          "en": "how you can use Midjourney also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.39,
          "end": 20.626,
          "en": "to create other types of content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.626,
          "end": 24.153,
          "en": "also in combination with these custom parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.47,
          "end": 28.08,
          "en": "If you are a content creator, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.08,
          "end": 31.56,
          "en": "you might need icons from time to time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.56,
          "end": 34.23,
          "en": "Of course, there are various icons available on the web",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.23,
          "end": 38.25,
          "en": "but often you can't find the exact icon you're looking for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.25,
          "end": 39.72,
          "en": "and especially you might want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.72,
          "end": 42.003,
          "en": "to have a more customized icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.84,
          "end": 46.89,
          "en": "Now, we can also use Midjourney for such purposes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.89,
          "end": 50.31,
          "en": "Let's get started very easily by just imagining",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.31,
          "end": 55.31,
          "en": "that we wanna have a trophy icon, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.56,
          "end": 58.353,
          "en": "that stands for success, et cetera.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.61,
          "end": 64.41,
          "en": "And this is Midjourney's interpretation of a trophy icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.41,
          "end": 66,
          "en": "which looks great in my opinion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66,
          "end": 68.34,
          "en": "but rather for a fantasy game.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.34,
          "end": 71.1,
          "en": "If you wanna have something more business-like,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.1,
          "end": 75.18,
          "en": "more serious, then you can easily tailor your prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.18,
          "end": 77.873,
          "en": "to get exactly the icon style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.873,
          "end": 80.793,
          "en": "and the icon type you are looking for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.72,
          "end": 86.52,
          "en": "So instead of just adding trophy icon, which we'll keep,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.52,
          "end": 89.67,
          "en": "we'll now also add a specific icon style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.67,
          "end": 94.25999999999999,
          "en": "in my case, I want to have the flat icon style, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.25999999999999,
          "end": 96.96000000000001,
          "en": "you could also use a line icon style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.96000000000001,
          "end": 100.97999999999999,
          "en": "a dual tone icon style, a colored outline style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.97999999999999,
          "end": 104.88,
          "en": "a 3D icon style, whatever icon style you have in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.88,
          "end": 106.62,
          "en": "whatever icon style you need,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.62,
          "end": 110.13,
          "en": "so you can add all these styles in here obviously.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.13,
          "end": 112.32,
          "en": "Now I don't want to have a background",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.32,
          "end": 115.92,
          "en": "so why don't we tell this Midjourney here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 115.92,
          "end": 119.34,
          "en": "And finally, I wanna be a bit more specific",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.34,
          "end": 121.77,
          "en": "about the colors that should be used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.77,
          "end": 125.13,
          "en": "We cannot use hex codes in Midjourney",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.13,
          "end": 128.13,
          "en": "at least at the point in time when I'm recording this video,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.13,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "so you can add hex codes, for example, to your prompt",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.16,
          "end": 133.53,
          "en": "but it doesn't work perfectly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.53,
          "end": 135.9,
          "en": "therefore, based on our experience,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.9,
          "end": 139.5,
          "en": "what works better is just adding the color in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.5,
          "end": 142.17000000000002,
          "en": "in my case, I'll use orange and purple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.17000000000002,
          "end": 145.38,
          "en": "You could also be more precise by adding bright orange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.38,
          "end": 147.88,
          "en": "bright purple, or even more colors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.88,
          "end": 150.06,
          "en": "We'll just keep it simple here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.06,
          "end": 151.95,
          "en": "therefore, this should now give us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.95,
          "end": 155.4,
          "en": "a way more specific output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.4,
          "end": 159.72,
          "en": "and hopefully four trophy icons in flat icon style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.72,
          "end": 164.133,
          "en": "with no background and in the orange and purple color tones.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.3,
          "end": 167.97,
          "en": "So now we got these four icons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.97,
          "end": 170.57999999999998,
          "en": "and these look a lot better actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.57999999999998,
          "end": 174.21,
          "en": "We have the trophies obviously in this flat icon style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.21,
          "end": 175.5,
          "en": "we got no background",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 175.5,
          "end": 177.69,
          "en": "just some slight shadows, which are okay,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.69,
          "end": 179.67000000000002,
          "en": "and the orange and purple colors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.67000000000002,
          "end": 182.61,
          "en": "were incorporated quite well, actually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.61,
          "end": 186.99,
          "en": "Now, as we typically don't only need one specific icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.99,
          "end": 190.59,
          "en": "but multiple icons in a certain style,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.59,
          "end": 193.65,
          "en": "we could just add the main parts of our prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.65,
          "end": 196.26,
          "en": "so basically this part here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.26,
          "end": 199.65,
          "en": "to a custom parameter, and then recreate icons",
