          "en": "Let's again open the prefer option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 214.38,
          "end": 219.38,
          "en": "and set this to flat icons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 221.19,
          "end": 224.973,
          "en": "Now add the value, which should simply be our text prompt,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 225.84,
          "end": 227.28300000000002,
          "en": "and now store this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 228.78,
          "end": 233.78,
          "en": "Now, we'll once again, create a new prompt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 235.5,
          "end": 240.5,
          "en": "This time I wanna have a computer icon maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 240.84,
          "end": 245.84,
          "en": "And now with dash dash flat icons, we get these four icons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 250.8,
          "end": 254.31,
          "en": "Now the interpretation is of course a bit different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 254.31,
          "end": 257.13,
          "en": "as we didn't use the describe command, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 257.13,
          "end": 259.8,
          "en": "to describe one of these individual icons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 259.8,
          "end": 262.14,
          "en": "and then create the new prompt based",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
